From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 17:24:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] graphics: expose Floral GPU presentation identity

Use the immutable Floral GPU identity properties for GLES vendor and
renderer strings and for Vulkan physical-device names. Keep the real Vulkan
IDs, extensions, features, limits, and rendering path unchanged.

Route both core and KHR Vulkan properties2 lookups through the override and
keep the generated entry-point table in sync with its generator.

---
diff --git a/opengl/libs/Android.bp b/opengl/libs/Android.bp
index c9fce8ad526f50db3220f23ea4744a8047df5aae..b14f68456c1694a1b457677cf6bdc9776cca5ab3 100644
--- a/opengl/libs/Android.bp
+++ b/opengl/libs/Android.bp
@@ -79,6 +79,7 @@ cc_defaults {
     ],
     static_libs: [
         "libarect",
+        "libfloral_gpu_identity",
     ],
     header_libs: [
         "bionic_libc_platform_headers",
@@ -89,6 +90,17 @@ cc_defaults {
     export_header_lib_headers: ["gl_headers"],
 }
 
+cc_library_static {
+    name: "libfloral_gpu_identity",
+    srcs: ["FloralGpuIdentity.cpp"],
+    cflags: [
+        "-Wall",
+        "-Werror",
+    ],
+    shared_libs: ["libcutils"],
+    export_include_dirs: ["."],
+}
+
 //##############################################################################
 // Build META EGL library
 //
